OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim sent hundreds of
OL,4,Athreats, jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man sent hundreds of threatening
OL,7,Fmessages in just hours to his boyfriend
OL,8,Fwho is accused of murdering him days
OL,9,Flater, a court heard.
OL,11,FDefendant Imran Uddin told a jury his
OL,12,Frelationship with Ismail Younis
OL,13,Fdeteriorated in the weeks before his
OL,14,Fpartner died, saying it was "not the
OL,15,Fbest" and that the pair bickered "all
OL,16,Fthe time" over his contact with another
OL,17,Fman.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
