OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim sent hundreds of
OL,4,Athreats, jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair exchanged around 1,000
OL,7,Fmessages on 17 August 2025, with some
OL,8,Fattributed to Younis including, "I want
OL,9,Fyou dead", "go die you" and "remember
OL,10,Fyour time is up", Birmingham Crown
OL,11,FCourt heard.
OL,13,FUddin, 33, denies murdering Younis
OL,14,Fwhose body was found at the defendant's
OL,15,Faddress on Richmond Road in Hockley,
OL,16,FBirmingham, three days later.
